<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: underwhelming  baptism -->
  <AM_BoringBaptism.stages.underwhelming_baptism.label>效果甚微的洗礼仪式</AM_BoringBaptism.stages.underwhelming_baptism.label>
  <!-- EN: The ceremony lacked the spirit and grace it deserved. It felt hollow and uninspired. -->
  <AM_BoringBaptism.stages.underwhelming_baptism.description>洗礼仪式效果甚微。这场仪式缺少了本该有的精神与庄重。我们只能感受到空洞与乏味。</AM_BoringBaptism.stages.underwhelming_baptism.description>
  
  <!-- EN: refreshing baptism -->
  <AM_FunBaptism.stages.refreshing_baptism.label>耳目一新的洗礼仪式</AM_FunBaptism.stages.refreshing_baptism.label>
  <!-- EN: That was a delightful moment of connection with the holy water. It left me feeling renewed. -->
  <AM_FunBaptism.stages.refreshing_baptism.description>洗礼仪式令人耳目一新。这场愉悦的仪式使我们与神圣的水紧密相连。这种精神焕新的感觉可真好。</AM_FunBaptism.stages.refreshing_baptism.description>
  
  <!-- EN: blasphemous  baptism -->
  <AM_TerribleBaptism.stages.blasphemous_baptism.label>亵渎的洗礼仪式</AM_TerribleBaptism.stages.blasphemous_baptism.label>
  <!-- EN: The ritual was an affront to the holiness of water. This desecration will linger in my thoughts. -->
  <AM_TerribleBaptism.stages.blasphemous_baptism.description>洗礼仪式亵渎且不敬！这场仪式简直就是在玷污水的圣洁性，我们的思想会因此而变得不纯洁！</AM_TerribleBaptism.stages.blasphemous_baptism.description>
  
  <!-- EN: transcendent baptism -->
  <AM_UnforgettableBaptism.stages.transcendent_baptism.label>超凡绝伦的洗礼仪式</AM_UnforgettableBaptism.stages.transcendent_baptism.label>
  <!-- EN: This ritual was a profound experience, an unforgettable communion with the sacred flow of life. -->
  <AM_UnforgettableBaptism.stages.transcendent_baptism.description>洗礼仪式超凡绝伦！这场仪式使我们经历了难以忘怀的体验，我们将永远铭记与生命之神圣水流间的沟通。</AM_UnforgettableBaptism.stages.transcendent_baptism.description>
  
</LanguageData>